{"type": "result", "subtype": "success", "is_error": false, "result": "The dock (the row of icons pinned along the bottom of the home screen) has four apps, left to right:\n\n1. **Phone** (calls)\n2. **Messages**\n3. **Contacts**\n4. **Chrome** (web browser)\n\n`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\nAndroid calls the dock the \"hotseat.\" It is the one row that stays put when you swipe between home screen pages, so whatever you pin there is always one tap away. Lawnchair keeps it at four icons here.\n`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`", "session_id": "f1275dc9-5c73-4798-bed9-54c4cadcdfd2", "num_turns": 2}
